{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"542063","name":"Ramada Plaza Malatya Altin Kayisi","description":"يقع هذا الفندق ذو الـ 5 نجوم في حيِّ يشيل يورت بمدينة ملطية، في مركز المدينة. يمكن للضيوف الاستمتاع بالسبا الكامل الخدمات بالفندق، والذي يشمل حمامًا تركيًا وساونا وغرفة بخار وخدمات المساج. يضم مكان الإقامة مطعمًا ومقهى وبارًا. وللترفيه، يتوفر مسبح داخلي ومركز للياقة البدنية. توفر جميع الغرف خدمة الواي فاي المجانية وتكييف الهواء وأجهزة تلفزيون إل سي دي. يقع الفندق على بُعد 3 دقائق سيرًا على الأقدام من حديقة سومر و13 دقيقة سيرًا على الأقدام من مركز تسوق MalatyaPark.","address":"Ozalper Mahallesi","city":"Malatya","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"44090","lat":38.3446942,"lng":38.2748783,"stars":5,"chain":"WYNDH","giataCode":"370782","phone":"+18008549517","website":"https://www.wyndhamhotels.com/ramada/malatya-turkey/ramada-plaza-malatya-altin-kayisi/overview","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_001.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.2Q","category":"room","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_002.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.C3-3","category":"room","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_003.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.C3-1","category":"room","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_004.jpg","roomCode":"DBL.ST","category":"room","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_005.jpg","roomCode":"SUI.QN-1","category":"room","order":7},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/54/542063/542063a_hb_ro_006.jpg","roomCode":"SUI.QN","c